# ===================================================================
# Line endings: LF everywhere for text, no conversion at all for
# binaries. Set explicitly rather than left to each developer's
# core.autocrlf, because that default is exactly what silently
# corrupted tests/fixtures/testsets/retention_v1.jsonl on 2026-08-05:
# a Windows checkout with autocrlf=true rewrote every LF to CRLF in
# the working tree during an ordinary `gh pr merge`, and
# testsets.load_testset refuses any file carrying a CR by design --
# so the suite broke on a checkout that changed no committed content
# at all, and no diff was visible because git's own autocrlf-aware
# diffing treated the two as equivalent.
#
# This is not just a style preference for two categories in this
# repo: tests/fixtures/testsets/*.jsonl evidence spans are matched as
# verbatim substrings of transcript_th, and every Prompt.sha in
# src/evalgen/prompts.py is a sha256 over exactly these bytes. A
# silently reflowed line ending changes both without changing
# anything visible on screen.
# ===================================================================
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: explicitly exempted from any text handling. Matters now
# that production-reference/ carries real images and .xlsx workbooks.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xlsm binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.zip binary
